const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="About — Jingcan Yang" description="About me" locale="en">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I am Jingcan Yang, a PhD student in Foreign Linguistics and Applied Linguistics
    at Zhejiang University, under the supervision of Prof. Cheng Gong.
  </p>
  <p>
    My research mainly focuses on Formal Syntax, Formal semantics and Distributed Morphology
    within the Minimalism approach. My current work explores cross-linguistic
    possessive/genitive structures — represented by the Chinese <em>de</em>-construction — and
    argument structure within DP. I believe that science, more often than not, is simple and
    beautiful, and linguistics is no exception.
  </p>
  <p>
    Beyond academia, I write fiction and design TRPG modules based on my original worldbuilding.
    I host TRPG sessions from time to time.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    📧 <a href="mailto:anorke@163.com">anorke@163.com</a><br />
    📍 Zijingang Campus, Zhejiang University, 866 Yuhangtang Road, Xihu District, Hangzhou, Hangzhou City, Zhejiang Province, China.
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href={`${base}cv_en_Jingcan Yang.pdf`} class="cv-download">Download CV (PDF)</a>
  </p>
</Layout>
